 del 2009. El 21 de junio del 2009, un grupo de 34 estudiantes de medicina de Nottingham, Reino Unido, viajó en avión de Londres a Nairobi. Durante el vuelo de 9 horas, un estudiante de sexo masculino de 22 años de edad presentó cefalea y escalofríos. De los otros 33 estudiantes y responsables del grupo estudiantil, 23 (70%) tuvieron fiebre subjetiva o síntomas en las vías respiratorias superiores durante junio 24--30, 3 a 6 días después de la aparición de los síntomas (21 de junio) en el paciente inicial.","hasAlt":true,"isDecorative":false,"isMissingAlt":false,"ariaHidden":false,"rolePresentation":false,"renderedWidth":399,"renderedHeight":263,"naturalWidth":399,"naturalHeight":263,"loading":null,"decoding":null,"altVerdict":"TOO_LONG","altReason":"alt text is 731 characters — consider a caption or description","bytes":8186},{"src":"https://www.cdc.gov/mmwr/images/spacer.gif","alt":" ","hasAlt":true,"isDecorative":false,"isMissingAlt":false,"ariaHidden":false,"rolePresentation":false,"renderedWidth":10,"renderedHeight":1,"naturalWidth":10,"naturalHeight":10,"loading":null,"decoding":null,"altVerdict":"DECORATIVE","altReason":"alt=\"\" (decorative)","bytes":821},{"src":"https://www.cdc.gov/mmwr/images/mmwr_archiveicon-old.gif","alt":null,"hasAlt":false,"isDecorative":false,"isMissingAlt":true,"ariaHidden":false,"rolePresentation":false,"renderedWidth":22,"renderedHeight":18,"naturalWidth":null,"naturalHeight":null,"loading":null,"decoding":null,"altVerdict":"MISSING","altReason":"no alt attribute","bytes":20905},{"src":"https://www.cdc.gov/mmwr/headers_footers/images/spacer1.gif","alt":"","hasAlt":true,"isDecorative":true,"isMissingAlt":false,"ariaHidden":false,"rolePresentation":false,"renderedWidth":1,"renderedHeight":1,"naturalWidth":10,"naturalHeight":10,"loading":null,"decoding":null,"altVerdict":"DECORATIVE","altReason":"alt=\"\" (decorative)","bytes":821},{"src":"https://www.cdc.gov/mmwr/images/spacer1.gif","alt":"","hasAlt":true,"isDecorative":true,"isMissi